@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

[*] --> Home

state Home <<choice>>
Home --> Projects : [Select projects]
Home --> Careers : [Select careers]

state Projects <<choice>>
Projects --> Photos : [View photos]
Projects --> Videos : [Watch videos]
Photos --> ProjectInfo : [Display info]
Videos --> ProjectInfo : [Display info]

state Careers <<choice>>
Careers --> Updates : [View updates]
Careers --> ApplicationForm : [Open form]
Updates --> CareerInfo : [Display info]
ApplicationForm --> Submit : [Submit application]
Submit --> Check : [Check submitted job applications]

Check --> [*] : [Completed check]

@enduml
